A||N||36||AusFiero||WOOOHOOOOOO||||6||
Z||000000||AusFiero||07-16-2001||11:50 PM||||Well friends I think the power of prayer must work because even though I am not a church going person myself the doctors are amazed at my leaps and bounds recovery (fastest back on the feet job the surgeon has ever seen. He reckons the rate I am going 2 weeks I will be a new man rather than a month). I am home. Still have to rest for a month, still weak from losing a lot of weight but all in all I am feeling the best I have felt in over 3 years.<P>Surgery went without a hitch (well some very minor loss of feeling in the left side of my face and my voice has changed a little, kinda husky and sexy now LOL) and I woke up feeling good. Other patients where staring in drop jawed awe watching me walk around the next day being cheerful and dieing to get home while they layed around trying to recover. <P>They had to leave part of the tumor there because it was attatched to the nerves that control breathing and swallowing, take them out and I die. But regular scans to make sure it don't grow back and I will live a perfectly normal life. <P>The sponge baths, well I read that this Cliff Pennock guy seemed to want them more so I told the nurses they best head to the Netherlands  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I was actually bathing no problems the next day, long hot soak in a bath and reading books etc. Man I feel great. And Cathetas, it will tingle a little removing it they say. If that was tingle please never introduce me to pain. <P>I am now going to scan the forum for about half an hour and catch up then follow docs orders and go to bed for a while. <P>Thanks again everyone for the well wishes. I really appreciate having so many people that care about me and I will try to catch up with as many of you as possible when I come to the USA for 10 days next spring/summer to tour a few Fiero shows.<P>Cheers All<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||6
